cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Periodic Table of Sound"
abstract: "A periodic table of musical elements ordered by time octave Z, measured on real recordings, with a sound collider for predicted elements. This version adds a four-test confirmation of periods, a strict benchmark for the level of the pulse (beat, subdivision or bar), a negative result on splitting events by band, and the research journal with its failed attempts. The research and the code were developed with Claude (Anthropic), an AI model."
authors:
